---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | AVARHQ" 
  description="Our privacy policy is simple: no registration, no data collection, and no advertisements.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 space-y-12 text-gray-400">
    <header class="border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter text-white mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-cyan-400">Zero Data Collection Guarantee</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 prose prose-invert prose-cyan max-w-none">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Absolutely nothing.</strong> AVARHQ operates without user accounts, registration systems, or backend databases designed to capture personal identifiable information (PII). We do not require an email address, name, or phone number to access any part of this website. </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">2. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
        <p>We do not use tracking cookies, analytics cookies, or third-party advertising cookies. The only client-side data stored on your device is a single <code>localStorage</code> flag used exclusively to remember that you have passed the 18+ age verification gate. This and other data never leaves your browser and is never transmitted because we actually don't have any servers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">3. Third-Party APIs</h2>
        <p>Our website interfaces with the AniList API and Jikan API to populate media data. When your browser queries these services (e.g., to fetch official streaming links), your IP address may briefly interact with their respective servers. We recommend reviewing their privacy policies if you have concerns regarding third-party API data handling.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">4. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions regarding this zero-data policy, you can reach out to us directly through our official Instagram page.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>